# Example requests. Replay these with the VS Code "REST Client" extension,
# or translate to curl. Run them top-to-bottom; the session cookie is kept
# between requests automatically by REST Client.

@base = http://localhost:3000

### health check
GET {{base}}/

### signup (also logs you in)
POST {{base}}/api/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "sumit", "password": "hunter2" }

### signup again with same name -> 409
POST {{base}}/api/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "sumit", "password": "whatever" }

### login
POST {{base}}/api/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "sumit", "password": "hunter2" }

### who am I (protected) -> 200 when logged in
GET {{base}}/api/me

### logout
POST {{base}}/api/logout

### who am I after logout -> 401
GET {{base}}/api/me
